From e96c08f514db6e4258aac911d137f5bfa2c3a48d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ondrej Jirman <megi@xff.cz>
Date: Tue, 21 Jul 2026 13:24:19 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: allwinner: sun50i-a64-pinephone: Sense VBUS
 enable on the PMIC

Set x-powers,sense-vbus-en so the PMIC forces N_VBUSEN to an input. The
pin is wired to the VBUS enabling switch on this board, and without it
the PMIC tries to charge while the board is generating VBUS itself.

Split out of "regulator: axp20x: Turn N_VBUSEN to input on
x-powers,sense-vbus-en", which mixed this DTS change with the driver
change that reads the property; the driver half stays on anx-7.1.
Signed-off-by: Ondrej Jirman <megi@xff.cz>
---
 arch/arm64/boot/dts/allwinner/sun50i-a64-pinephone-1.2.dts | 4 ++++
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+)

diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/allwinner/sun50i-a64-pinephone-1.2.dts b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/allwinner/sun50i-a64-pinephone-1.2.dts
index ad8f0e5e5112..fc017473a240 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/allwinner/sun50i-a64-pinephone-1.2.dts
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/allwinner/sun50i-a64-pinephone-1.2.dts
@@ -15,6 +15,10 @@ wifi_pwrseq: wifi-pwrseq {
 	};
 };
 
+&axp803 {
+	x-powers,sense-vbus-en;
+};
+
 &backlight {
 	power-supply = <&reg_ldo_io0>;
 	lth-brightness = <12>;
-- 
2.43.0

